        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220180/extras/office?t=1767252487\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220180/extras/b295991013ee14a16bfba48745a769e3.avif?t=1767252487\" width=1078 height=582 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful daycare once filled with laughter and children… now left abandoned, silent, and hiding something twisted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone investigator exploring the ruins of Little Smiles Daycare. Uncover hidden clues, recorded memories, mysterious artifacts, and a truth that was never meant to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you’re not alone.<br>Something else is watching.<br>And smiling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore. Listen. Investigate.</strong><br>Will you uncover what happened here?<br>Or will Mr. Smiles find you first?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voice-acted cutscenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror and secret lore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden clues, endings, and twists to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10-15 minutes of gameplay per run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple outcomes, choose carefully</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗝️ Voice Talent</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ms. Harper</strong> – Hannah Willhouse<br>Instagram: @HannahWacting<br>YouTube: HannahWillhouseVA</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mr. Smiles</strong> – Kobe Van Bogaert<br>Twitter: @KobeVB_VA</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore at your own pace, solve environmental puzzles, follow the clues, and reveal the daycare’s darkest moments. Every step draws you closer to the truth, and to something watching from just beyond the halls…</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220180/extras/office?t=1767252487\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220180/extras/b295991013ee14a16bfba48745a769e3.avif?t=1767252487\" width=1078 height=582 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful daycare once filled with laughter and children… now left abandoned, silent, and hiding something twisted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a lone investigator exploring the ruins of Little Smiles Daycare. Uncover hidden clues, recorded memories, mysterious artifacts, and a truth that was never meant to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you’re not alone.<br>Something else is watching.<br>And smiling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore. Listen. Investigate.</strong><br>Will you uncover what happened here?<br>Or will Mr. Smiles find you first?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voice-acted cutscenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror and secret lore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden clues, endings, and twists to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10-15 minutes of gameplay per run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple outcomes, choose carefully</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗝️ Voice Talent</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ms. Harper</strong> – Hannah Willhouse<br>Instagram: @HannahWacting<br>YouTube: HannahWillhouseVA</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mr. Smiles</strong> – Kobe Van Bogaert<br>Twitter: @KobeVB_VA</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore at your own pace, solve environmental puzzles, follow the clues, and reveal the daycare’s darkest moments. Every step draws you closer to the truth, and to something watching from just beyond the halls…</p>",
